title: "nextgen-typing"
abstract: "Coordination monorepo for the hyperpolymath type theory pipeline. Holds no compiler or application code: it documents the pipeline roadmap and inter-repo relationships, and hosts the cross-project formal-verification proofs in verification/proofs/."
